{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1000_p", "source_sha256": "96e095989eb7200424915e1bedb78cda9c8d7e5bbf23e27fa22740d26a319b36", "ja": "（三国志をテーマにしたドラマへの出演が決まった響。\n今は届いた台本をもとに、打ち合わせをしている）", "zh": "（响确定出演一部以《三国志》为主题的电视剧。现在正根据收到的剧本进行商讨）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "44d80703cc270ad7f239557d7bb65fc8849572cbd236ecea1880c4e7578bc838", "ja": "どの武将も、本当にカッコいいよね～。\n自分、何度も台本読み返しちゃった！", "zh": "每位武将都真的很帅气呢～  \n我都忍不住把剧本读了好几遍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1002_p", "source_sha256": "93fab16726da1b93f69e11a278926e123df5574a26d5fad1e8db6c155cf7aada", "ja": "ははっ、すっかり気に入ったみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，看样子你已经彻底喜欢上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "01c6181f81e58a33399afc515d5ae037243591710666ea2f87d2e1060e5d7512", "ja": "うん！　もし自分がこの時代に生まれてたらって\nイメージしてたら、すっごく楽しくて！", "zh": "嗯！我一想到要是自己出生在这个时代，会是什么样子，就觉得特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "b9f3432587a54693eb994cecaa40a77140c26e22c80a66599db638ad8c07d7e7", "ja": "三国志の世界の自分は、きっと歴史に名前を残す、\n強くてカッコいい武将になってると思うんだ。", "zh": "我想，在三国志的世界里，自己一定会成为名留青史、又强大又帅气的武将。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1005_p", "source_sha256": "379b7d7369bb015009d596759231c34184df402410cbcf2937440fbf222e2df9", "ja": "おお、いいじゃないか！　武将・我那覇響……\n名前からして、強そうな感じがするもんな。", "zh": "哦，不错嘛！武将·我那霸响……光听名字，就感觉很强呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "83e7fc31144171bdd700e5a58e6e7048fd6acc24a569243eabe4c7a3b5a4a8aa", "ja": "でしょ？　それに自分は何でもカンペキにこなせるし、\n向いてると思うんだよね、武将！", "zh": "对吧？而且我可是无论什么都能完美做到的，\n我觉得自己很适合当武将！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1007_p", "source_sha256": "db0f94431a5e152e3c385ae72258ed33e9ef9fcdbe3f0fbf04a80444bbab6845", "ja": "そうだな。戦乱の世の中を必死に生き抜く姿は、\n人を惹きつける魅力に溢れているからな……。", "zh": "是啊。在乱世中拼命求生的身姿，充满了吸引人心的魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3030e18ac2e03357fb34c465353c7d51a3656d5871673d94d7839a77229e41d3", "ja": "そう考えると、\nなんだかアイドルと似てるのかもしれないな。", "zh": "这么一想，或许和偶像还真有点像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "39c4865fc3332d132c0fecc3287ed240d7a481f60ff1651c69156d8c41543c77", "ja": "確かにそうかも……！　アイドルの世界も\n三国志と同じくらい、熱くて激しい戦いだよね。", "zh": "说得也对……！偶像的世界\n跟三国志一样，都是激烈而热血的战场呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "fce0f6fc83cde0fe89a989c9e4651c7a78f8e73e9b6b375805982de89b601750", "ja": "でも戦いに勝ち続ければ……トップアイドルになれば、\n歴史に名前を残せるアイドルになれる……。", "zh": "不过，只要不断赢得战斗……只要成为顶尖偶像，就能成为名留青史的偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1011_p", "source_sha256": "02353901c9e86b19b413854ced63653bd859dac7d8792ee0519ad5e296710f62", "ja": "ああ。アイドルはいつだって戦国時代だからな。\n響が勝ち続けられるように、俺も協力するよ。", "zh": "是啊。偶像界无论何时都处于战国时代。\n为了让响能够不断获胜，我也会帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "ea4a400c9e58cfa34d0c55a1019fdbdcd63301431ed705e4addc846111325139", "ja": "わあ～……なんかグッときたぞ！\n今の言葉、武将を支える軍師みたい！", "zh": "哇～……不知怎么的，心里一阵激动！\n刚才那句话，简直就像辅佐武将的军师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f9406afc585bbab91e3688544b163721563a772c70b9f1940575c3c57a7e3f99", "ja": "軍師か……。まあ、プロデューサーの仕事も\nアイドルを支えるから、似てるかもな？", "zh": "军师啊……嗯，制作人的工作也是支持偶像，或许确实挺像的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "fe51110e37dbbb835405461849170ab72728f75fe1c98180d1c23fffa33c976e", "ja": "うん、そうだぞ！　今日から\n{$P$}は、自分の軍師ね！", "zh": "嗯，就是这样！从今天起，{$P$}就是我的军师了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0493_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "ee0843a7e829777b7b37f72d7edef7d946318bef4fc7c6864e33383dbfb61f64", "ja": "目指せ、歴史に名前を残すアイドル……！\nまずは一緒に、このドラマを成功させようね♪", "zh": "目标是成为名留青史的偶像……！\n首先，我们一起让这部电视剧取得成功吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
